#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x8f30 (id 0xae, record 0), budget 65 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x8f30/0
msgid "Hey, weren't you looking for something around there a while back?"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x8f30 (id 0xae, record 0), budget 14 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x8f30/1
msgid "What was it..."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x8fe0 (id 0xc9, record 0), budget 36 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x8fe0/0
msgid "Oh, right! The truck with the nukes."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x8fe0 (id 0xc9, record 0), budget 66 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x8fe0/1
msgid "You were checking the backs of all the conspicuous-looking trucks."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x90b0 (id 0x78, record 0), budget 52 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x90b0/0
msgid "Zadornov's inside one of the trucks. I'm sure of it."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x0 (id 0xb1, record 204), budget 45 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x0/0
msgid "Careful. If there's enemy scouts around here,"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x0 (id 0xb1, record 204), budget 36 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x0/1
msgid "they'll be nearly impossible to see."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xc0 (id 0x8d, record 204), budget 68 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xc0/0
msgid "Keep your eyes peeled. Enemy scouts could be hiding almost anywhere."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x150 (id 0x8d, record 204), budget 70 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x150/0
msgid "Watch out. Enemy Search may not spot enemies that are actively hidden."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1e0 (id 0x8c, record 204), budget 69 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1e0/0
msgid "The Surround Indicator is also effective for spotting hidden enemies."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x270 (id 0x92, record 204), budget 72 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x270/0
msgid "A fall from there would be certain death...even for a superman like you."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x310 (id 0x7b, record 204), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x310/0
msgid "Look at that... Mother Nature's paintbrush at work."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x390 (id 0xa5, record 204), budget 33 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x390/0
msgid "That pile of rubble's in the way,"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x390 (id 0xa5, record 204), budget 41 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x390/1
msgid "but some C4 should make short work of it."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x440 (id 0x10c, record 204), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x440/0
msgid "Some scouts are really hard to spot"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x440 (id 0x10c, record 204), budget 56 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x440/1
msgid "because they use grass or dirt to camouflage themselves."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x440 (id 0x10c, record 204), budget 50 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x440/2
msgid "They blend right in with the natural surroundings."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x550 (id 0xc1, record 204), budget 65 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x550/0
msgid "You'll be difficult to spot in the jungle wearing a Ghillie suit."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x550 (id 0xc1, record 204), budget 23 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x550/1
msgid "Become one with nature."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x620 (id 0xd9, record 204), budget 66 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x620/0
msgid "That flower that looks like a crab's claw is Heliconia Latispatha."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x620 (id 0xd9, record 204), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x620/1
msgid "Hummingbirds will often come to drink their nectar."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x700 (id 0x93, record 204), budget 68 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x700/0
msgid "You can't get into the lab without an ID card. Go back and find one."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x7a0 (id 0x6e, record 204), budget 42 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x7a0/0
msgid "You need to get yourself an ID card first."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x810 (id 0xc2, record 204), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x810/0
msgid "Find the soldier with the ID card."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x810 (id 0xc2, record 204), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x810/1
msgid "The soldier is in the woods near a singing quetzal."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x8e0 (id 0x72, record 204), budget 45 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x8e0/0
msgid "Ruins?! Think there's treasure hidden inside?"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x960 (id 0xc4, record 204), budget 78 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x960/0
msgid "It'd be nice if I could cobble together a high-performance portable radar unit"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x960 (id 0xc4, record 204), budget 28 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x960/1
msgid "for you here at Mother Base."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xa30 (id 0x8f, record 204), budget 72 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xa30/0
msgid "Sighting enemies would be a cinch with a pair of night vision goggles..."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xac0 (id 0x69, record 204), budget 27 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xac0/0
msgid "Shame you left them behind."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xb30 (id 0x7d, record 204), budget 52 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xb30/0
msgid "Snipers and laser sights are a deadly combination..."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xbb0 (id 0x5c, record 204), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xbb0/0
msgid "Watch out for the red lasers."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xc10 (id 0x59, record 204), budget 26 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xc10/0
msgid "They've got a bead on you!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xc70 (id 0x85, record 204), budget 54 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xc70/0
msgid "There may be snipers hidden in the jungle. Be careful."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xd00 (id 0x6e, record 204), budget 53 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xd00/0
msgid "If anything looks suspicious out there, check it out."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xd70 (id 0x80, record 204), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xd70/0
msgid "A good sniper changes position as soon as he's spotted."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xdf0 (id 0x7e, record 204), budget 60 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xdf0/0
msgid "Be ready for an ambush. There's too many hiding places here."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xe70 (id 0x75, record 204), budget 44 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xe70/0
msgid "There could be enemies anywhere. Stay sharp."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xef0 (id 0xca, record 204), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xef0/0
msgid "There's supposed to be a quetzal singing"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xef0 (id 0xca, record 204), budget 59 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xef0/1
msgid "close to where your target is located. Keep your ears open."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xfc0 (id 0xc3, record 204), budget 41 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xfc0/0
msgid "If you forget what a quetzal sounds like,"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0xfc0 (id 0xc3, record 204), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0xfc0/1
msgid "give Cecile a CALL on the radio. She'll remind you."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1090 (id 0x9c, record 204), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1090/0
msgid "The soldier carrying the ID card"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1090 (id 0x9c, record 204), budget 43 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1090/1
msgid "is supposed to be wearing an orange jacket."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1130 (id 0x81, record 204), budget 65 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1130/0
msgid "Make sure you don't kill the soldier when you do your body check."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x11c0 (id 0x80, record 204), budget 61 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x11c0/0
msgid "Once you know which soldier has the ID card, do a body check."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1240 (id 0xdc, record 204), budget 68 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1240/0
msgid "To do a body check, first knock the soldier out or put him to sleep."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1240 (id 0xdc, record 204), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1240/1
msgid "Or hold him up - that works too."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1320 (id 0x79, record 204), budget 57 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1320/0
msgid "Need a reminder of that quetzal call, hmm? Kyohhh kyohhh."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x13a0 (id 0x6d, record 204), budget 52 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x13a0/0
msgid "Kyohhh kyohhh... That is what a quetzal sounds like."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1410 (id 0x62, record 204), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1410/0
msgid "Kyohhh kyohhh. ...Well? Pretty good, hm?"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1480 (id 0x8e, record 204), budget 23 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1480/0
msgid "Oink, oink! Oink, oink!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1480 (id 0x8e, record 204), budget 21 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1480/1
msgid "Oops, that was a pig!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1510 (id 0x79, record 204), budget 49 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1510/0
msgid "There he is! That is the man who took my ID card!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1590 (id 0x7e, record 204), budget 56 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1590/0
msgid "Yes...that is definitely the quetzal. He must be nearby!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1610 (id 0x77, record 204), budget 45 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1610/0
msgid "Now look for a soldier with an orange jacket."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1690 (id 0x78, record 204), budget 52 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1690/0
msgid "What you are hearing is the Rufous-collared Sparrow."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1710 (id 0x74, record 204), budget 47 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1710/0
msgid "The quetzal sounds like this -- kyoooh, kyoooh!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1790 (id 0x5d, record 204), budget 36 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1790/0
msgid "That is the sound of the House Wren."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x17f0 (id 0x6d, record 204), budget 52 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x17f0/0
msgid "I believe that is perhaps...the Common Yellowthroat."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1860 (id 0x52, record 204), budget 18 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1860/0
msgid "Snake, pick it up!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x18c0 (id 0xb2, record 204), budget 49 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x18c0/0
msgid "You'll have to unequip the Fulton recovery device"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x18c0 (id 0xb2, record 204), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x18c0/1
msgid "before you do the body check."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1980 (id 0xc9, record 204), budget 54 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1980/0
msgid "You wouldn't want to accidentally do a Fulton recovery"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1980 (id 0xc9, record 204), budget 24 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1980/1
msgid "instead of a body check."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1bd0 (id 0x83, record 204), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1bd0/0
msgid "Guess this one didn't have the ID card after all. Keep looking."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1c60 (id 0x8b, record 204), budget 25 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1c60/0
msgid "He did not have the card?"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1c60 (id 0x8b, record 204), budget 32 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1c60/1
msgid "It couldn't have been him, then."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1cf0 (id 0x87, record 204), budget 60 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1cf0/0
msgid "I could have sworn it was him... Maybe it was somebody else?"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1d80 (id 0x8b, record 204), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1d80/0
msgid "Guess that wasn't the one. I'm not hearing the quetzal, either."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1e10 (id 0x8a, record 204), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1e10/0
msgid "I bet you could use that ID card you found to get into the lab."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1ea0 (id 0x6a, record 204), budget 36 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1ea0/0
msgid "That card will get you into the lab."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c677285 block 0x1f10 (id 0x69, record 204), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c677285/0x1f10/0
msgid "Kyohhh kyohhh. ...Hm? Oh, have you had enough?"
msgstr ""
